From 06c20d44e3e646401bffb43ca3f5fda73488b2af Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] FreeChat: tell rooms with auto-delete about screenshots

On Android 14 and later, a screenshot of a room with auto-delete sends
an emote ("* Alice took a screenshot") that every client shows and that
expires like the other messages; at most one every 30 seconds per room.
Rooms that block screenshots do not need it.

The screenshot rules of a room now also apply to its threads: the
room's own screenshot blocking was missing there.
